<title>GREECE: BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague championship matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Athens: </p>
<p>Panathinaikos (Greece) 66 Villeurbanne (France) 72 (halftime 29-42)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Panathinaikos - Nikos Economou 16, Byron Dinkins 13</p>
<p>Villeurbanne - Delaney Rand 31, Brian Howard 14</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000.  </p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>In Athens:</p>
<p>Panionios (Greece) 92 Limoges (France) 77 (44-41)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Panionios - Fanis Christodoulou 23, Keith Gatling 22, Mitchel Wiggins 21</p>
<p>Limoges - Jan Bonato 18, Vern Fleming 17</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000  </p>
<p>In Ljubljana:</p>
<p>Olimpija Ljubljana (Slovenia) 77 Barcelona (Spain) 65 (44-33)</p>
<p>Leading scorers: </p>
<p>Olimpija - Marko Milic 16</p>
<p>Barcelona - Arturas Karnisovas 15</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,500</p>
</text>
